init.description:
{title} keeps trying to start, but fails every time.

- Last error: {reason}
- Offline since: {since}
- Came back by itself in the past week: {returns_7d}

**Reload** sometimes fixes this, for example after a network problem.

**Allow offline for a while** if it is switched off now and then, such as a TV or a solar inverter at night. If it came back by itself several times this week, that is probably the case. **Ignore** if it may be offline for good. Both can be changed later on the Device Doctor page.

